WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.758 --> 00:00:04.051
Building self-driving car has
been a dream of my life and

00:00:04.051 --> 00:00:06.530
I've dedicated more
than ten years to it.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.480
If you can build a safer car,
we would save a lot of lives.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.813
But on top of it, it's transformational.

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:16.732
Just imagine instead of owning a car,
you have a little phone and

00:00:16.732 --> 00:00:18.030
you summon a car.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.863
And an empty car comes to you, you just
jump in and let's you go somewhere.

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:24.840
And when you don't need it
any more it disappears.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.750
There is an enormous market for
self-driving car engineers.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.800
Lot's and lot's of companies
that you wouldn't suspect have

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.610
entered that field and
are massively hiring.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.829
I challenge everybody
here to be part of this.

00:00:36.829 --> 00:00:40.912
We're launching in Udacity a [INAUDIBLE]
program called Self-Driving Cars, so

00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:44.404
that everyone in the world can
become a self-driving car engineer.

00:00:44.404 --> 00:00:44.904
[MUSIC]

